{"metas":[{"id":"tt23052950","type":"series","name":"Deli Boys","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//zsjiNaXqbWUCKFyU72N5HpALcUu.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt23052950/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt23052950/img","description":"When their convenience store-magnate father suddenly dies, a pair of pampered Pakistani American brothers lose everything and are forced to reckon with their Baba's secret life of crime as they attempt to take up his mantle in the underworld.","releaseInfo":"2025"},{"id":"tt35617850","type":"series","name":"The Fox Hollow Murders: Playground of a Serial Killer","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//ag4ryAskmt4637kLR6XVeE5tpaU.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt35617850/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt35617850/img","description":"Hamilton County coroner Jeff Jellison launches a new investigation into Herb Baumeister decades after thousands of bones were found in the woods behind Fox Hollow Farms, Baumeister's stately home. Using new DNA technology, Jellison and his team work to identify the human remains, bringing long-deferred closure to victims' families and unearthing unsettling questions about potential accomplices, missing evidence, and a key witness whose story keeps changing.","releaseInfo":"2025"},{"id":"tt27805520","type":"series","name":"Muslim Matchmaker","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//q7AlGvMxmUKZSF1HTbGuddRI8l4.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt27805520/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt27805520/img","description":"From cringey first dates to moments of profound connection, matchmakers Hoda Abrahim and Yasmin Elhady support their clients in navigating the complexities of dating with the intention of marriage while staying true to their values and beliefs.","releaseInfo":"2025"},{"id":"tt35747193","type":"series","name":"Wicked Game: Devil in the Desert","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//cQeV41TT7x23VEXGHXXjmwCnZhB.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt35747193/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt35747193/img","description":"Hunting the mastermind of a violent abduction, authorities unravel a twisted tale of obsession during the early days of legalized pot.","releaseInfo":"2025"},{"id":"tt27444205","type":"series","name":"Paradise","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//l8RqfhqEk04W5sSOjQ9zeWU1DyM.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt27444205/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt27444205/img","description":"The tranquility in a serene, wealthy community inhabited by some of the world's most prominent individuals explodes when a shocking murder occurs and a high stakes investigation unfolds.","releaseInfo":"2025"},{"id":"tt35460841","type":"series","name":"Faces of Music","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//ApyiomJgpG4tpbYUgnYnsqyrmV5.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt35460841/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt35460841/img","description":"Examines the most exciting musicians today through the lens of beauty and makeup.","releaseInfo":"2025"},{"id":"tt27487379","type":"series","name":"On the Run","poster":"https://images.metahub.space/poster/medium/tt27487379/img","background":"https://images.metahub.space/poster/medium/tt27487379/img","description":"An adrenaline-driven, heart-pounding, half-hour series covering America’s extreme police chases, featuring unprecedented access to news footage and exclusive interviews with cops, critics, reporters and those who almost got away.","releaseInfo":"2025"},{"id":"tmdb:281666","type":"series","name":"Goosebumps: The Vanishing","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//ajghauMTZ4RKVeISDUzxcMWjXnI.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//ajghauMTZ4RKVeISDUzxcMWjXnI.jpg","description":"When twins Devin and Cece are sent to spend a summer in Gravesend, Brooklyn with their divorced dad, scientist Anthony Brewer, they must band together with new friends to save the neighborhood from a long-dormant threat.","releaseInfo":"2025"},{"id":"tt37626285","type":"series","name":"Buddy's Holiday Recipe Rumble","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//zf1CEYqbrzlSEN2rIp4c1i7t3oQ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//zf1CEYqbrzlSEN2rIp4c1i7t3oQ.jpg","description":"Buddy Valastro hosts two families who battle by showcasing their most delicious, crowd-pleasing holiday dishes.","releaseInfo":"2024"},{"id":"tt21477490","type":"series","name":"Vow of Silence: The Assassination of Annie Mae","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//763MzoY4NPYk09p6SbSEv8r3Kru.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt21477490/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt21477490/img","description":"This true crime docuseries examines the murder of Annie Mae Aquash – a Mi'kmaq woman from Nova Scotia, Canada, a mother of two daughters, a teacher, and a revolutionary who fought for Indigenous rights in the 1970s whose death went unsolved for almost 30 years.","releaseInfo":"2024"},{"id":"tt13354972","type":"series","name":"Interior Chinatown","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//7lyvgPGYNNBt9EPyBotS7U1i1Kp.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt13354972/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt13354972/img","description":"Willis Wu, a background character trapped in a police procedural, tries to find his way into the larger story–and along the way discovers secrets about the strange world he inhabits and his family's buried history.","releaseInfo":"2024"},{"id":"tt35360179","type":"series","name":"Cookie Cupcake Cake","poster":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/544/1361201.jpg","background":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/544/1361201.jpg","description":"Which of America’s best bakers can master mind-blowingly inventive, visually stunning, decadently delicious desserts in three top sweets categories? Every standalone episode of this totally fresh, utterly appealing dessert competition series challenges pro baker-decorators to conquer the three “C’s” of sweets in escalating rounds of detail, flavor complexity, and grandeur. Welcome to Cookie Cupcake Cake!","releaseInfo":"2024"},{"id":"tt34710765","type":"series","name":"Cake Toppers","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//4It9fOujEodLL0MVwa0Ia7ZUsaB.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//4It9fOujEodLL0MVwa0Ia7ZUsaB.jpg","description":"Buddy Valastro hosts a cake competition with a wicked twist! Round one, artists create detailed cakes; round two the final teams must swap cakes and elevate designs! It's a game of artistry, strategy, and cake engineering asking, can you top that?","releaseInfo":"2024"},{"id":"tt29100397","type":"series","name":"It's All Country","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//6rAjBgDjTLz1tZU54DtSiE7icEo.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt29100397/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt29100397/img","description":"Behind every country song is an untold story. Country music super star Luke Bryan explores the hidden depths of Nashville in search of those stories. The series features never-before-seen performances by some of the biggest stars of country music as Luke uncovers the secrets, the hidden inspirations and the personal moments that shaped the music you love.","releaseInfo":"2024"},{"id":"tt31122777","type":"series","name":"Say Nothing","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//bAF3gTGuFNDdzGUIAnDqi5nbFf3.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt31122777/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt31122777/img","description":"Through the eyes of various Irish Republican Army (IRA) members, explore the extremes some people will go to in the name of their beliefs, the way a deeply divided society can suddenly tip over into armed conflict, the long shadow of radical violence for both victims and perpetrators, and the emotional and psychological costs of a code of silence.","releaseInfo":"2024"},{"id":"tt21382958","type":"series","name":"La Máquina","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//hDsIZmWVr4kTJFjgZ8Gwzx6nDJD.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt21382958/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt21382958/img","description":"After a devastating loss, Esteban “La Máquina” Osuna is at a low point in his boxing career. Lucky for him, his manager and best friend Andy Lujan is determined to get him back on top. But when a nefarious organization rears its head, the stakes of this rematch become life or death. Esteban must juggle his own personal demons and protect his family.","releaseInfo":"2024"},{"id":"tt33484143","type":"series","name":"OUT THERE: Crimes of the Paranormal","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//Zk5IF6ZRunDn8NAbzSuw99mn8X.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt33484143/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt33484143/img","description":"Go inside eight true crime cases with shocking encounters with the paranormal world - through eyewitness accounts, expert interviews, and all-new investigations. In each case, amidst an agonizing search for answers, one rumor emerges from the pack: something inhuman is afoot.","releaseInfo":"2024"},{"id":"tt33362536","type":"series","name":"Little Miss Innocent: Passion. Poison. Prison.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//m5Wpd5wEDdvu6tiVrfAu4Abb2kw.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt33362536/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt33362536/img","description":"Speaking for the first time since her conviction for the killing of her ex-boyfriend's mother, Kaitlyn Conley goes on camera to assert her innocence.","releaseInfo":"2024"},{"id":"tt23730262","type":"series","name":"How to Die Alone","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//161kiFeNwUQVPyXOzBDrlnphKM0.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt23730262/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt23730262/img","description":"Mel is a broke, fat, Black JFK airport employee who's never been in love and forgotten how to dream, until an accidental brush with death catapults her on a journey to finally take flight and start living by any means necessary.","releaseInfo":"2024"},{"id":"tt21906238","type":"series","name":"Rivals","poster":"https://resizing.flixster.com/LXSXGuN6MYc4FSerfHo40pXije0=/ems.cHJkLWVtcy1hc3NldHMvdHZzZXJpZXMvMWNmMDBkMTctNTUzZS00NjM0LThmMDItMjAzNWRiOTFmYmFiLmpwZw==","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt21906238/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt21906238/img","description":"Tomatometer 94%"},{"id":"tt31289994","type":"series","name":"The Lowdown","poster":"https://resizing.flixster.com/-XZAfHZM39UwaGJIFWKAE8fS0ak=/v3/t/assets/p30237650_b_v12_ad.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt31289994/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt31289994/img","description":"Tomatometer 99%"},{"id":"tt10752770","type":"series","name":"Tyler Perry's Sistas","poster":"https://resizing.flixster.com/-XZAfHZM39UwaGJIFWKAE8fS0ak=/v3/t/assets/p17380108_b_v13_an.jpg","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt10752770/img","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt10752770/img","description":""},{"id":